    <node id="Fictional Reference World">
      <data key="d0">Fictional Reference World</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Fictional Reference World is a conceptual, abstract setting employed within the registry to host and organize entries and their interrelationships. It serves as an imagined backdrop where registry entries, subregions, and the relationships among them are defined and referenced. Explicitly described as fictional, this world functions as the current reference context for all registry operations and definitions, providing a unified backdrop for the registry’s structure and interactions. In this hypothetical environment, the registry entry and its relationships are defined, making the Fictional Reference World the conceptual geographic setting that underpins the registry’s organization.&lt;SEP&gt;A fictional world referenced by the registry entry.&lt;SEP&gt;The conceptual world in which the registry entry exists.&lt;SEP&gt;A hypothetical or imagined world used as a context for the registry entries.&lt;SEP&gt;A conceptual setting referred to as the current fictional reference world in which registry entries describe relationships.</data>
      <data key="d3">D1e6fcd119ed03eaa5770-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D31d7efaecc9dac0459f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D340ca21d12f63d1cd917-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3987590ecfb6040326d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3bf755801edbd55b30c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D47c49cfab181f97b6a71-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D484ceaf31f69109851b6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D4ff1724729c0dc75dac1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D51c37d21d0db8f1e9c74-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D69ab7fa586361d0bba4c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6ae5922c2a4aebab2026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6d1b7dca231782eb5c7f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D76413fefe6657c0277f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D87e6c533b79da8158b89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D8e1819f9a41f64977ff5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9a3ed82160e45022573d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dacb8c3df2f00f4b6989f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db8ef2d8f24e3cb70b9e7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db9e4de6b351db6a50856-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dbb866ffea43863d04da8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc3ec77827ceea4dcff0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1555d1f4e34553d103d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1b71a1b0a096adfd662-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd6372989d953584ef556-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd9fb9c37159b590d129d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Ddd90b4110e833cad50f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Ddf4508c438a35f9493ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De3f35bb5cd2daf23678e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De4e2983cbee815e6065b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De5d52bc41134b6f51dcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Deb75e238ae54da5ebf3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Df08f83e6fbc691cf3e31-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dfa8525393f12be468392-chunk-000</data>
