    <node id="Source Assertion">
      <data key="d0">Source Assertion</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Source Assertion

A source assertion is a statement recorded by a registry entry that asserts a fact or relationship. It is documented within that entry and stands independently, without being evaluated against or cross‑checked with other registry entries. The assertion may originate from the entry itself or from an external source cited by the entry, but it does not involve any validation or comparison with additional registry data. In essence, a source assertion serves as a source within the registry entry, providing a conceptual statement that is recorded without evaluating other entries. It may identify the relationship between a subregion and its parent region or simply assert a relationship, but in all cases the assertion is not evaluated against other entries.&lt;SEP&gt;Assertion that is recorded by the registry entry.&lt;SEP&gt;An assertion recorded by a registry entry that is not evaluated against other registry entries.&lt;SEP&gt;A statement that claims a fact without evaluating other registry entries.</data>
      <data key="d3">D1e6fcd119ed03eaa5770-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D213d059cbf8275626d71-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D31d7efaecc9dac0459f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D32fee42740fc2d3298a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3987590ecfb6040326d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3bf755801edbd55b30c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D484ceaf31f69109851b6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D4ff1724729c0dc75dac1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D51c37d21d0db8f1e9c74-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D69ab7fa586361d0bba4c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6ae5922c2a4aebab2026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6d1b7dca231782eb5c7f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D813a5727276cc4bd97d1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D87e6c533b79da8158b89-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D8c8029e8c48a14776585-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D8e1819f9a41f64977ff5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9a3ed82160e45022573d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dacb8c3df2f00f4b6989f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db8ef2d8f24e3cb70b9e7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db9e4de6b351db6a50856-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dbb866ffea43863d04da8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc3ec77827ceea4dcff0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1555d1f4e34553d103d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1b71a1b0a096adfd662-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd6372989d953584ef556-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd9fb9c37159b590d129d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Ddd90b4110e833cad50f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De251762bf8dc191c5046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De4e2983cbee815e6065b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De5d52bc41134b6f51dcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Deb75e238ae54da5ebf3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Df08f83e6fbc691cf3e31-chunk-000</data>
