    <edge source="Registry Entry" target="Source Assertion">
      <data key="d7">26.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation (Registry Entry, Source Assertion) specifies that a registry entry records a source assertion. In this relationship, the source assertion is part of the registry entry, and the registry entry serves as a container that documents the assertion independently of any other entries in the registry. The registry entry contains the source assertion, capturing it without evaluating other registry entries. This relationship indicates that the registry entry records and holds the source assertion, thereby preserving the assertion’s information within the registry.&lt;SEP&gt;The registry entry records a source assertion.&lt;SEP&gt;Registry Entry records a source assertion.</data>
      <data key="d9">assertion,asserts,contained_in,contains,describes,records,relation</data>
      <data key="d10">D1e6fcd119ed03eaa5770-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D213d059cbf8275626d71-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D31d7efaecc9dac0459f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D32fee42740fc2d3298a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3987590ecfb6040326d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3bf755801edbd55b30c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D484ceaf31f69109851b6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D4ff1724729c0dc75dac1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D51c37d21d0db8f1e9c74-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D69ab7fa586361d0bba4c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6ae5922c2a4aebab2026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6d1b7dca231782eb5c7f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D813a5727276cc4bd97d1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D8c8029e8c48a14776585-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D8e1819f9a41f64977ff5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D9a3ed82160e45022573d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dacb8c3df2f00f4b6989f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db8ef2d8f24e3cb70b9e7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc3ec77827ceea4dcff0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1b71a1b0a096adfd662-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd9fb9c37159b590d129d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Ddd90b4110e833cad50f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De251762bf8dc191c5046-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De5d52bc41134b6f51dcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Deb75e238ae54da5ebf3e-chunk-000</data>
