    <edge source="Registry Entry" target="Fictional Reference World">
      <data key="d7">20.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation **(Fictional Reference World, Registry Entry)** indicates that a registry entry is situated within the Fictional Reference World. It confirms the entry’s location inside this world and specifies that the entry describes a relationship that is part of that fictional context. The relation therefore serves to both locate the registry entry within the Fictional Reference World and to define the nature of the relationship it records.&lt;SEP&gt;The registry entry describes the relationship within the fictional reference world.&lt;SEP&gt;The registry entry is situated within the fictional reference world.&lt;SEP&gt;Registry entry describes the relationship within the fictional reference world.</data>
      <data key="d9">context,describes,describes in,describes relationship in,describes_in,exists in,exists_in,in,located in,location,relation,set_in</data>
      <data key="d10">D1e6fcd119ed03eaa5770-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D31d7efaecc9dac0459f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D3bf755801edbd55b30c7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D47c49cfab181f97b6a71-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D484ceaf31f69109851b6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D4ff1724729c0dc75dac1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D51c37d21d0db8f1e9c74-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D69ab7fa586361d0bba4c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6ae5922c2a4aebab2026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D6d1b7dca231782eb5c7f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;D8e1819f9a41f64977ff5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Db8ef2d8f24e3cb70b9e7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dc3ec77827ceea4dcff0a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1555d1f4e34553d103d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Dd1b71a1b0a096adfd662-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Ddd90b4110e833cad50f5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;Ddf4508c438a35f9493ca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De3f35bb5cd2daf23678e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De5d52bc41134b6f51dcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;De791e97b2b1adf07df4f-chunk-000</data>
